{"ref":"BDB, תָּו²","hw":"תָּו²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תָּו</span></big>  <strong>n.m. mark</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span>, <em>mark</em> on forehead, sign exemption from judgment <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.4\">Ez 9:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.6\">6</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּוִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 31:35\" href=\"/Job.31.35\">Jb 31:35</a> = <em>my</em> (written) <em>mark</em> (in attestation).","next":"BDB, תַּאֲוָה³","prev":"BDB, תוה"}